<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div><div class="kicker" data-i18n="s1_kicker">01 / Services</div><h2 data-i18n="s1_h1">Precision<br>in every detail.</h2></div>
    <p data-i18n="s1_desc">A full suite of residential services delivered with the quality and attention your home deserves.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card1_num">01 — PLUMBING</span><h3 data-i18n="card1_h3">Expert<br>plumbing.</h3><p data-i18n="card1_p">From leak repairs to full system installations — licensed plumbers you can trust for every job.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card2_num">02 — ELECTRICAL</span><h3 data-i18n="card2_h3">Safe &amp;<br>reliable.</h3><p data-i18n="card2_p">Wiring, panel upgrades, lighting and fixture installation by certified electricians.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card3_num">03 — HVAC</span><h3 data-i18n="card3_h3">Climate<br>control.</h3><p data-i18n="card3_p">Heating, ventilation and air conditioning installation, maintenance and emergency repair.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card4_num">04 — PAINTING</span><h3 data-i18n="card4_h3">Flawless<br>finishes.</h3><p data-i18n="card4_p">Interior and exterior painting with premium materials and meticulous attention to detail.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card5_num">05 — LANDSCAPING</span><h3 data-i18n="card5_h3">Outdoor<br>transformation.</h3><p data-i18n="card5_p">Lawn care, garden design, hardscaping and seasonal maintenance for curb appeal.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card6_num">06 — CLEANING</span><h3 data-i18n="card6_h3">Deep clean<br>specialists.</h3><p data-i18n="card6_p">Move-in/move-out cleaning, post-renovation cleanup and recurring maintenance plans.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 16px }
  .glass { position: relative; min-height: 330px; padding: 27px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.085),rgba(255,255,255,.018));
    box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px); transform-style: preserve-3d; transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .3s ease; overflow: hidden }
  .glass:before { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 190px; height: 190px; right: -80px; top: -80px; background: var(--red); filter: blur(80px); opacity: .14 }
  .glass:hover { box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12) }
  .card-num { font-size: 10px; color: #777e88; letter-spacing: .18em }
  .glass h3 { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-size: 30px; margin: 80px 0 12px; transform: translateZ(35px) }
  .glass p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 320px; transform: translateZ(22px) }
  .card-line { position: absolute; left: 27px; right: 27px; bottom: 28px; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,var(--red),transparent) }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr }
    .glass { min-height: 280px }
  }
</style>
